WEBVTT

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.050
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.730
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.830
What kind of story do we have today?

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:13.920
We will meet a girl who is very good at fortune-telling.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.530
Doki! Amu-chan finally confesses?!

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.670
Yep, a turn of events no one could possibly predict!

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.380
No kidding. It's gonna be fun times again!

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.560
Doki!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.080
Howa Howa

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.280
Kira Kira

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:42.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:58.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:05.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.800
I can do anything!

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:15.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:24.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:28.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:36.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:40.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:42.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.520
Howa Howa

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.730
Kira Kira

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:46.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.810
Today's Lucky Star Horoscope is...

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.840
Lucky Star Horoscope

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.850
Like this!

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.090
Oh, I'm fifth-most lucky!

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:04.340
And I'm third! What about you, Ami-chan?

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.470
Second!

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.520
Congratulations! {Hey, does dad have on a shirt promoting marijuana? }

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.850
It says something fun will happen today.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:13.180
Yay! Today's gonna be gweat!

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.520
Gweat, gweat, gweat!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.520
Libra.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:17.700
And today's number one is...

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.550
Libra!

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:22.270
It's going to be a lucky day, complete with a wonderful event!

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:23.310
All right!

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.790
Congratulations to you, too, Amu-chan!

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:26.810
Whatever.

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.930
It's an especially good day for love!

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:30.180
Love?

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:34.720
If you confess to someone you love, your feelings might reach them!

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.660
Confess?!

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:41.510
You are at that age, Amu-chan. There's nothing odd about liking a boy.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.780
Dear!

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.600
I wike boys, too!

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:53.720
Takashi-kun and Yuya-kun and Kazunori-kun and Satomi-kun and Yuu-kun!

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.620
S-Say it ain't so.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.520
Confess?

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.220
Why do I picture two faces?!

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:05.220
How unfortunate. Leos have the worst luck today!

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:09.040
So you're a Leo, Lulu?

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.290
Who cares about horoscopes, anyway?

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.160
They're obviously all a farce!

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:19.100
Lucky Days are for Love Confessions?

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:19.120
Episode 60

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.720
It's so cute!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.780
Hinamori-san, what is this?

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:28.700
It's a dollhouse. Although, it's more of a "Guardian Character" house now.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.700
Oh? So it's a house for the Guardian Characters.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.970
Ami begged my parents to buy it.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:36.940
She said she wanted to make a house for them.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.720
Ami-chan certainly is kind, isn't she?

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:40.290
Well...

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.110
You'd think, but...

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:54.640
Let's make you nice and pretty.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.220
Good morning.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.760
What the heck is this?!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:08.000
We can't even rest peacefully in our own rooms.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.810
It is just too hard for us.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.840
So that's why they moved.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.560
Besides, everyone can use it here, right?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.580
Nice idea-dechu!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.560
It's everyone's house!

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:22.210
But is Ami-chan okay with this?

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.910
It was unexpectedly easy, actually.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.660
You're such a wittle kid, Sis.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.620
Okay, fine, I wet you borrow it.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.060
She's already bored with it.

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:36.460
This room on the top floor shall be mine!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.150
As for the rest of you, we'll split them up accordingly.

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.170
Don't just decide on your own!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.430
He's more of a tyrant than a king-dechu!

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:49.970
Tyrant, tyrant, tyrant!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:54.220
If you confess to someone you love, your feelings might reach them!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.020
Confess?

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:00.570
But he already turned me down once, didn't he?

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:02.680
I do!

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.050
The truth is, I like you, Prince!

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.840
But that was Ran's doing.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.980
It wasn't really me telling him myself.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:19.390
Look, look! It's an autographed poster from DARTS!

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:21.680
I won the grand prize in a draw!

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.020
Oh, so you did win.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:26.700
You said I'd get something I wanted soon, Koyomi, and I did!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.340
Your fortune-telling was spot on again, Koyomi-chan!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:31.720
Amazing! Just like a pro!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.480
Oh, I'm not that...

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.910
No, you're better than a pro.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:39.640
Because your fortune-telling technique is original, Koyomi.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:42.260
A combination of astrology and the four pill...

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:43.470
What was it again?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:47.130
The fours pillars of destiny, or the nine star ki astrology.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:52.270
I combine various basic astrological theories, which gets me pretty close to the mark.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.580
Good morning!

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.040
Everyone, please take your se-

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.400
Sensei, are you okay?

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:15.270
My horoscope this morning said something good would happen today if I did the opposite of what I normally do.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:18.430
Uh, isn't that taking it a bit literally?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.470
And now, it is break time!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:27.680
Fortune-telling can be divided into three types: Destiny, Decision, and Reading.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:35.060
I mainly focus on studying how to use one's birth date to predict personality and luck, which is a Destiny technique.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:35.080
Reading       Decision      Destiny

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:42.810
I think fortune-telling is like guiding people down the path of happiness.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:47.560
But to even discern the laws of the heavens is...

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:53.470
I'm sorry! I'm too obsessed about this, aren't I?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.120
You're totally awesome!

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.960
Thinking about all that complicated stuff like that.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.180
So do you want to be a fortune-teller when you grow up, Koyomi-chan?

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:03.860
That might be nice, yeah.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.680
Are fortune-tellers ever <i>actually</i> right?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.130
I don't believe in that stuff.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.640
It's all just guessing anyway.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.230
It's not guessing!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:17.640
Koyomi's fortune-telling is all based on data!

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.640
Like, you know...

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.680
Statistics.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.890
Right, that!

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.070
My goodness, isn't this fascinating.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.640
Would you be so kind as to tell me my fortune?

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:28.610
She's back!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.200
We haven't seen her in a while.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.660
Fortune Notes

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.640
Your fortune is:

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:38.480
You will walk the path of a common person, with no great discord in your life.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.640
That's what I see.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.430
Excuse me? Hold on a second!

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:45.660
I should be walking a path resplendent with romantic ups and downs!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:51.140
For example, being scouted as a magnificent actress, or marrying a prince of some distant country!

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.220
But...

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:55.460
How rude! I guess you're just an amateur, after all!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:59.810
Wait! The sign of the flood appears, so watch out for water!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.310
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.200
Just as she predicted!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.360
Wow!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.310
She's the real deal!

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:12.750
Wait just a...

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.720
Are you all right, Yamabuki-san?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.600
Tadase-sama, thank you so much!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.220
Uh, sure.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.010
Tadase-sama.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:28.350
Tadase-kun is so cool.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:33.300
Fortune-telling? I'd get mine told if it would actually turn out to be true.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.760
Should I actually confess today?

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.140
Amu-chan!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.640
Want to try it, Amu-chan?

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:41.650
Sure, okay. I'll-

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.140
But...

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:46.880
You aren't interested in things like fortune-telling, right, Hinamori-san?

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.660
I guess not, yeah.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:50.890
I'm actually crazy interested!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.850
What about you, Mashiro-san?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.970
If Amu does it first, then I will.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:01.300
Okay, then. I guess I've gotta do it.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:09.680
You are a kind person who values friends and family.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:13.400
You tend to fret about the gap between who people see you as, and your inner self.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.850
Oh? That's surprising.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:19.150
Well, that's not totally off, I suppose.

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:21.560
She hit the nail on the head!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.810
This is a good period for fate.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:27.810
If there is something you desire, this might be the time to make your decision.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:31.140
I wonder if that means I should confess now?

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:34.080
However, it seems as though you want two things.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.760
Anything in particular come to mind?

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.640
Huh? No idea!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.740
Oh, yeah!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.640
Tell Rima's fortune, okay?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:49.850
Since entering this school, it seems the circumstances surrounding you have changed significantly.

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:52.510
Well, obviously things change when you transfer schools.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.760
Well, yeah, but...

00:09:55.760 --> 00:10:00.350
It's hinted that sunlight has begun to peek through the heavy clouds in your heart.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:07.140
For example, the worries you once kept to yourself, you now share with others. Isn't that right?

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:11.310
I wonder if she's talking about the Guardians.

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:13.280
Beats me.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:17.410
The fortune-telling was a great success!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.870
Girls really enjoy fortune-telling, don't they?

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:24.640
Everyone is interested in what will happen to them in the future.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.870
You can't predict everything with fortunes, though.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.530
No one can really know what'll happen tomorrow.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.760
I know about tomorrow!

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.010
Here we go!

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.600
Tomorrow will be sunny!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:42.310
I guess that's another type of fortune-telling.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:47.090
Oh yeah, I didn't ask her whether I should confess or not.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.350
After I confess, what's next?

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.830
Should I just call him Tadase?

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.830
But first, what do you even say in a confession?

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:56.600
What's the matter?

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:59.100
N-N-Nothing!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.470
I can see it. I can see it.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.080
What are you doing?

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.960
It looks like he's suddenly awakened.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.260
There it is!

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:11.680
Kiseki! You will soon lose something very important to you.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:13.550
Utter nonsense!

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.680
Heave, ho!

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.060
Cleaning is finished!

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.050
Now I can take a nap-dechu!

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:23.290
M-My room!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.500
You were right.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.790
I fear my own gift.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.880
He loves me, he loves me not. He loves me, he loves me not.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.020
He loves me?

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:36.060
Oh my! Fortune-telling is so romantic!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.980
Amu-chan, your lucky day will be over soon.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.250
If you're gonna confess, you'd better hurry!

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.260
Yeah, do it now! Go!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.290
Right, but...

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:01.750
He might be taken by someone else if you don't hurry.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.250
The prince is very popular, you see.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.680
She's right, Amu-chan!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:10.900
Yeah, but maybe another, even more amazing, ultra-lucky day is coming.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:13.760
I was thinking I'd maybe wait for that, or something.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.820
I don't think a day like that...

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:17.260
Will actually come, though.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:26.520
Whoa, what a pretty girl.

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:29.210
You are the fortune-telling prodigy, correct?

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:32.290
Rumors about you have spread all the way to my school.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:34.590
Oh my, I'm not that...

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:37.010
I was wondering if you might tell me my fortune.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:43.860
Um, although you look bold on the outside, you are actually very delicate.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.510
Deep inside your heart, you feel that there are many things you'd like to do.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:50.500
But you just can't take the first step.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.010
Something like that, maybe?

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:55.590
Heck yeah, bull's eye!

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.890
You got some talent there, Missy!

00:12:57.890 --> 00:13:01.260
Sorry, but that is completely incorrect!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:03.220
I-I'm sorry.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:08.180
Fortune-telling is just mistaking coincidences for correct predictions.

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:11.850
Your friends might believe in it,

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:16.720
but if your predictions end up wrong, they might turn on you.

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:18.970
If you'll excuse me.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:26.970
The next day!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.130
I suspect something will happen today!

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:29.970
Doki!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.930
Good morning, Koyomi!

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.340
Good morning.

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:35.200
Is something the matter?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.090
Oh, it's nothing.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:37.930
Really?

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.120
Okay then, will you tell me my fortune?

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.110
Predict my fate!

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.180
Sure.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:48.390
This Month's Destiny

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.390
It looks like today is your lucky day, Marika.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.640
And it even says it's the luckiest day of the year.

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:51.640
Lucky Day!! Everything will go your way!! Best Fate!! The best time this term!! If you are worried about something, now's the time to decide!!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:52.870
Really?

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:53.670
Good morning.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.430
Good morning, Tadase-kun.

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.370
Yo, Tadase.

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:04.670
I wonder if I should confess to Tadase-kun today.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.600
You said it was my luckiest day of the year, right?

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:09.560
It'll go well, right?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:10.920
It'll be fine.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:11.810
I think.

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:14.300
All right! I'm gonna go for it!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.960
But I'm so nervous!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.890
Please be my moral support, okay?

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:19.820
S-Sure.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.050
Af...

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:22.650
...ter...

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:23.160
Scho...

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.030
...ol!

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:25.140
Huh?

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:27.140
It's Tadase-kun.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.470
Where's he off to?

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:34.980
I'm sorry. Were you waiting long?

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.040
No.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:39.100
What's going on here?!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.390
Hinamori-san.

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:43.610
Uh, I was just passing by and...

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.560
Is that... Is she confessing to him?

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:48.310
Yeah.

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:53.850
It looks like you were beaten to the punch.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:58.060
Tadase-kun, I've loved you for a long time!

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:02.950
Thank you.

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:05.510
But I can't reciprocate your feelings.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:09.760
I'm already in love with another girl.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:12.760
He loves someone?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.760
And, well, about the second thing...

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.680
Hinamori-san.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.900
What was Tadase-kun going to say then?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.740
I'm not...

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:27.180
I'm not good enough, after all!

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.820
It looks like she's really concerned about something.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.800
I'm quite worried.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.360
Let's go, Amu-chan.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:39.120
Amu-chan!

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:40.930
Right.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.960
I wasn't right.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.080
What should I do?

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.970
Maybe I should just stop telling people's fortunes.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.010
You're lost, aren't you?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.480
It's you!

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:01.260
You really want to tell fortunes, don't you?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.510
But...

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:04.390
If they're wrong, then there's no point to it.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.760
I will let your dream come true.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:09.700
Huh?

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:16.110
If you wear this, your fortunes will be much more accurate.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:27.260
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:30.260
? Character Change.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.390
I wonder where she went.

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:36.040
Amu-chan, I'm sensing the presence of a ? Egg!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.390
Could it be...

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:43.010
That's right! If I want to tell fortunes, I should just go for it!

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:50.600
Come on out, y'hear!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:57.390
Character Transformation: Fortune Dream!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:03.350
I'll tell you all your futures!

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:10.220
Get a move on! Get to it!

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:18.760
I see the sign of the flood appearing for you!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.600
You should beware of what's overhead!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.640
Your luck with money will be the worst today!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.050
My wallet!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:36.170
Today's unlucky colors are red, blue, and yellow!

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:37.760
S-Sorry!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:43.440
If everyone knows their futures, they can be happy!

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.160
Koyomi-chan!

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:47.050
Ow...

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:48.640
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:50.890
Hey, get your butt down here!

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:50.930
Coming!

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.140
My wallet!

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:58.390
We have to do something! This is really bad!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.390
Today's Character Transformation will be...

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.310
My heart:

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.970
Unlock!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.750
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.490
Oh, it was Clover.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.100
Stop this, Koyomi-chan!

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:38.500
Why? I'm telling everyone what will happen in their futures.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:39.200
But...

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.930
It's kind of a bit far-fetched, yeah.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.560
I'll tell you your fate!

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:51.470
It looks like your luck at studying will be bad tomorrow.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.180
For real?

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:56.600
But in exchange, your popularity luck will be the best!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.930
H-Hey, wait, what?

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.180
Amu-chan!

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:09.130
Give me a break!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.680
I'll handle this!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.910
Honey Bubbles!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.050
There's more where that came from!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:28.370
Same to you!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.770
Koyomi-chan!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.750
Didn't you say fortune-telling is about guiding people down the path of happiness?

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:43.150
Look around you!

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:45.240
Is anyone happy?

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.600
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.350
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:50.350
Be more careful!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:55.590
All I was thinking about is whether my fortunes were right.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.620
I didn't even consider the people I was telling them to.

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:02.400
I have no right to tell people's fortunes!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:09.180
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:12.220
So if you like telling fortunes, just do it!

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:15.200
Negative Heart:

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.470
Lock On!

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:22.490
Open Heart!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.780
Oh, thank you.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.220
Huh? What happened?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.380
Koyomi-chan!

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:00.350
Huh? Hinamori-san?

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:03.680
Where am I?

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.600
Koyomi!

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:08.990
Marika.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.140
You disappeared so suddenly, it took me by surprise.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.760
Marika.

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:15.920
I'm sorry!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:17.600
My fortune was wrong!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:22.780
Don't worry about it. You can't be right all the time, Koyomi.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:24.140
I'm still glad.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:25.310
Huh?

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.920
Thanks to you, Koyomi, I finally confessed!

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:31.360
Sure, he turned me down, but I feel like a weight's been lifted!

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:35.720
All right! Starting tomorrow, I'm gonna find myself an even greater guy!

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:37.220
Oh, that's good.

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.810
Thanks for watching my back.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:45.060
No problem.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:48.680
Fortune-telling can be helpful in this way, too.

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:54.000
Maybe the lucky part was about old love ending and new love beginning?

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:57.180
Though it'll be nice if next time her feelings are accepted.

00:21:57.180 --> 00:21:59.410
One day, I'll also...

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:00.910
